Page 15-after line 22 Insert and renumber as necessary:

"Section 2. There is appropriated two hundred fifty thousand dollars
($250,000.00) from the general fund to the University of Wyoming for purposes
of the Wyoming veteran loan repayment program established under W.S. 21-16-
2001, as created by section 1 of this act. This appropriation shall be for the
period beginning with the effective date of this act and ending June 30, 2026.
This appropriation shall not be transferred or expended for any other purpose
and any unexpended, unobligated funds remaining from this appropriation shall
revert as provided by law on June 30, 2026. It is the intent of the legislature
that this appropriation be included and doubled in the standard budget of the
University of Wyoming for the immediately succeeding fiscal biennium but not be
included in any subsequent fiscal biennium.".
